    <!--
      200 — DB-GENERATED UUID PRIMARY KEYS (the org-wide admin-bff migration; exemplar:
      merged mod-bff #36). Stops the app minting UUID primary keys (UUID.randomUUID())
      and lets Postgres generate them via a gen_random_uuid() column DEFAULT, read back
      on insert via INSERT ... RETURNING id. The column type + entity @Id type are
      UNCHANGED — only the id SOURCE moves to the DB. STAGE 1 migrates the 3 native-uuid
